Changes made in this fork, relative to mlop at commit 57d49ac:

  - The server, previously a set of separate repositories (mlop-ai/server,
    web, ingest, py) run with ClickHouse, PostgreSQL, MinIO and Traefik, was
    replaced by a single standard-library Python package in this repository
    (mini_mlop_server) that stores data in SQLite and on the local filesystem,
    with a new web UI.
  - The Python client (mlop) was changed to talk to that single server,
    to store API keys in a local file instead of the system keyring, and to
    treat numpy, pillow, soundfile and the NVIDIA bindings as optional.

The logo in design/ and mini_mlop_server/web/favicon.svg comes from mlop.
